		<td class=3D"normal-td" style=3D"font-size: 10px;">
      	<br><div class=3D"news"><div align=3D"left">Hey everyone!<br>
<br>
It's been a long time since we've updated much and we are soon going to cha=
nge that. A lot has been going on behind the scenes to rejuvenate Hack This=
 Site, and to bring you so much more. We'd like to share some of the plans =
with you, but first some background.<br>
<br>
Hack This Site is old in a lot of ways. It turned 20 years old in 2023, but=
 the code is also old and so are the challenges, even the server design is =
outdated. This organization has always been a volunteer effort and never an=
yone's full-time job, which meant balancing working on Hack This Site along=
side a day job and a personal life. As the code, servers, and content becam=
e increasingly outdated, this balance became impossible for most and extrem=
ely challenging for the rest. Time, finances, and resource opportunities ne=
ver fully aligned to refresh and update everything -- until now.<br>
<br>
We will have more details to share soon, but the first one is that we expec=
t to complete a server migration in the next 2-3 months, ending in February=
 or March. From there the recode begins and a lot more will change pretty q=
uickly: new website, new challenges, return of the forums, and so much more=
.<br>
<br>
And as always, we are looking for more volunteers to support. If you are a =
web developer, systems administrator, or network engineer by trade and woul=
d like to help, please reach out to staff in our <a href=3D"https://www.hac=
kthissite.org/discord">Discord server</a>.<br>
<br>
Happy hacking!</div></div>
